{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛テスト勉強中。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眠い......あ、今目閉じたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝ちゃう！やばい、どぅする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここはあれだ。えっと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか必殺！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高速まばたきーーーーーーーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんまりっか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9201229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9201229/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...あと3回で300回更新ですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何かやりたくて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、何をすれば良いか、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからなくて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か良いのあるかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆるく考えましょう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/22/9201229/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の質問回答で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子力高いメンバーに関して意外！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というコメントが多かった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいは理想の女の子な感じなの♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねも料理できるし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragr